{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1228148-social-charms-and-a-great-curse-to-be-an-annoying-sidereal","id":1228148,"title":"Social Charms and a Great Curse to be an annoying Sidereal","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-17T16:54:14-07:00","id":1228148,"title":"Social Charms and a Great Curse to be an annoying Sidereal","content":"The story mode of <i>BlazBlue</i> Cross Tag Battle has reminded me all over again why I hate Rachel Alucard as a person, and each aspect is disgustingly Sidereal.<br /> <br /> I swear, she must gain Limit from revealing any information that others actually want to know, given how much effort she puts into avoiding that. She'd also have an Integrity Charm specifically to resist any attempt to make her talk.<br /> <br /> On top of that, a Socialize effect (if not a Socialize Charm) that represents always hinting she knows even more than what she actually reveals, even when she doesn't know anything. Impenetrable to Read Motivation effects.<br /> <br /> A Presence effect to convince you she totally planned for something to happen when it was completely outside of her control.<br /> <br /> Some other social effect to deflect the blame for her fuck-ups back on other people, or to distract others by needlessly insulting someone else.<br /> <br /> Maybe her specific Limit Trigger is denying having any feelings for someone she has feelings for, while also frequently putting that guy into situations where other women throw themselves at him as she denies being jealous? Or is that just her personal kink?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-17T20:20:34-07:00","id":1228196,"title":"","content":"Oh, and I forgot &quot;actually reveal the information that people would want to know, but couched in terms that your audience doesn't have any context to understand, so that you actually reveal nothing at all&quot;. While also refusing to give a similar explanation to anyone who would actually understand what you're talking about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T00:17:46-07:00","id":1228219,"title":"","content":"There\u2019s a webcomic I read once where someone, frustrated with how little a seer was telling her, said <br /> <br /> \u201cHey, there\u2019s this amazing technology humans have discovered. It\u2019s called the Straight Answer. I bet you\u2019d love it. I can show you how it works.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAre you saying I am too cryptic?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYES! See? It\u2019s easy. You should try it.\u201d<br /> <br /> ....Granted his defense is that, once he impacts a situation he can no longer see that person\u2019s future. For awhile anyway, but I doubt Rachel and Sidereals can use that loophole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T05:06:59-07:00","id":1228255,"title":"","content":"Obviously just showing up and throwing cryptic nonsense at someone impacts a situation, so that's bullshit.<br /> <br /> And it can't be that their ignorance would lead them to perform the kind of actions she wants, since nearly always their ignorance leads them to perform precisely the actions she doesn't want. Which she then blames on their supposed lack of intelligence, unreasonable brutality, or low breeding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}